Basic syntax:

UPDATE table_name
SET column_name = value
WHERE condition;



1. Update one row:

UPDATE students
SET age = 22
WHERE id = 1;



2. Update multiple columns:

UPDATE students
SET name = 'Rahim Uddin',
    age = 23
WHERE id = 1;



3. Update multiple rows:

UPDATE students
SET age = age + 1
WHERE age < 21;



4. Update all rows:

UPDATE students
SET age = 25;
